{"updated_at": {"date": {"d": "14", "m": "09", "Y": "2026"}, "time": {"H": "21", "M": "07", "S": "57"}}, "news": [{"title": "Odisha RERA asks promoters to furnish updated occupancy, CC details within 30 days", "para": "The Odisha Real Estate Regulatory Authority has set new guidelines requiring promoters to upload updated certificates within thirty days of receipt. Non-compliance could lead to penalties and potential restrictions on property registration. Additionally, promoters seeking approval must present proof of application and payment. This initiative is designed to promote transparency and safeguard the interests of homebuyers.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/rera/odisha-rera-asks-promoters-to-furnish-updated-occupancy-cc-details-within-30-days/134242235?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-77114/134242235.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "rera"}, {"title": "Suraksha Group to invest \u20b93,000 crore to complete pending Jaypee towers by September 2028", "para": "Suraksha Group, which acquired Jaypee Infratech, has invested about \u20b91,500-2,000 crore so far in construction and expects to invest another \u20b93,000 crore to complete the remaining towers by September 2028. The company has also outlined plans for three integrated townships across about 465 acres.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/residential/suraksha-group-to-invest-3000-crore-to-complete-pending-jaypee-towers-by-september-2028/134240973?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-121598/134240973.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "residential"}, {"title": "Reliance MET City appoints Manish Jaiswal as CEO; Embassy Developments names Neel Virwani as CBO", "para": "Reliance MET City has appointed Manish Jaiswal as chief executive officer to lead its business and growth strategy. Embassy Developments has appointed Neel Virwani as chief business officer, effective October 1, 2026, to drive expansion across North and West India.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/industry/reliance-met-city-appoints-manish-jaiswal-as-ceo-embassy-developments-names-neel-virwani-as-cbo/134237783?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-32278/134237783.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "industry"}]}